<title>UK: Euromoney says appoints new directors.</title>
<headline>Euromoney says appoints new directors.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euromoney Publications Plc said on Friday it had appointed Colin Jones as new finance director of the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, it said it had also appointed Richard Jell and Edoardo Bounous as executive directors.</p>
<p>All three appointments are with immediate effect, the statement said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542 7717</p>
